# String (mut) Methods

## Modification
push_str(&str)              Append a string slice
insert_str(usize, &str)     Insert string at position
push(char)                  Append a character
insert(usize, char)         Insert char at position
pop() -> Option<char>       Remove last char
remove(usize) -> char       Remove char at position

## Truncation
clear()                     Empty the string
truncate(usize)             Keep only first n bytes
retain((char) -> bool)      Keep only chars matching predicate

## Memory
reserve(usize)              Reserve additional capacity
reserve_exact(usize)        Reserve exactly additional capacity
shrink_to_fit()             Shrink capacity to length

## Advanced
split_off(usize) -> String  Split into two strings
replace_range(RangeBounds<usize>, &str)
drain(RangeBounds<usize>) -> Drain

